 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Payment Cryptography Control Plane API (2021-09-14). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Aliases are configuration metadata that never name a key: creating, importing or exporting a key generates or carries key material, so CreateKey, ImportKey, ExportKey, GetParametersForImport, GetParametersForExport, certificates, key usage, replication and every other key operation return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. KeyArn is refused with ResourceNotFoundException on CreateAlias, UpdateAlias and ListAliases because no key exists; UpdateAlias without KeyArn keeps the alias unassociated. Tagging applies to keys only and returns UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501; the separate data-plane service (encryption, PIN, MAC and card data operations) is not served.",
  "title": "AWS Payment Cryptography (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2021-09-14"
 },
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
